<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>SitoSubito - Crea il tuo sito web personalizzato in pochi click</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        /* RESET E STILI BASE */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif;
        }
        
        :root {
            --primary: #4361ee;
            --secondary: #3a0ca3;
            --accent: #ff6b6b;
            --success: #06d6a0;
            --warning: #ffd166;
            --light: #f8f9fa;
            --dark: #212529;
            --gray: #6c757d;
        }
        
        body {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            color: #333;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        
        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }
        
        /* HEADER MIGLIORATO */
        header {
            background: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            padding: 15px 0;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        
        .header-content {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }
        
        .logo {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 800;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }
        
        .logo i {
            margin-right: 10px;
            color: var(--accent);
        }
        
        .logo span {
            color: var(--accent);
        }
        
        nav ul {
            display: flex;
            list-style: none;
        }
        
        nav ul li {
            margin-left: 25px;
        }
        
        nav ul li a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: color 0.3s;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }
        
        nav ul li a i {
            margin-right: 5px;
        }
        
        nav ul li a:hover {
            color: var(--accent);
        }
        
        .cart-icon {
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .cart-count {
            position: absolute;
            top: -8px;
            right: -8px;
            background: var(--accent);
            color: white;
            border-radius: 50%;
            width: 18px;
            height: 18px;
            font-size: 12px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        
        /* HERO SECTION MIGLIORATA */
        .hero {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 80px 0;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary) 0%, var(--secondary) 100%);
            color: white;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .hero::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: url('data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 1000 100" fill="%23ffffff" opacity="0.05"><polygon points="1000,100 1000,0 0,100"/></svg>');
            background-size: cover;
        }
        
        .hero-content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        
        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }
        
        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }
        
        /* BOTTONI MIGLIORATI */
        .btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background: var(--accent);
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 50px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 1rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        
        .btn i {
            margin-right: 8px;
        }
        
        .btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
        }
        
        .btn-large {
            padding: 15px 35px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }
        
        .btn-primary {
            background: var(--primary);
            color: white;
        }
        
        .btn-success {
            background: var(--success);
            color: white;
        }
        
        /* SEZIONI MIGLIORATE */
        .section {
            padding: 60px 0;
        }
        
        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            color: var(--secondary);
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .section-title::after {
            content: '';
            display: block;
            width: 80px;
            height: 4px;
            background: var(--accent);
            margin: 15px auto;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }
        
        /* CARD DEI PACCHETTI MIGLIORATE */
        .packages {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }
        
        .package {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 35px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            border: 2px solid transparent;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            height: 100%;
        }
        
        .package:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
            border-color: var(--primary);
        }
        
        .package.popular {
            border-color: var(--accent);
            transform: scale(1.03);
        }
        
        .package.popular::before {
            content: 'POPOLARE';
            position: absolute;
            top: 20px;
            right: -30px;
            background: var(--accent);
            color: white;
            padding: 8px 35px;
            transform: rotate(45deg);
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        
        .package h3 {
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            color: var(--secondary);
        }
        
        .package .subtitle {
            color: var(--gray);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
        
        .price {
            font-size: 2.8rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin: 20px 0;
            color: var(--primary);
        }
        
        .price span {
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: var(--gray);
            font-weight: normal;
        }
        
        .features {
            list-style: none;
            margin: 25px 0;
            text-align: left;
            flex-grow: 1;
        }
        
        .features li {
            padding: 10px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }
        
        .features li i {
            color: var(--success);
            margin-right: 10px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }
        
        .features li.disabled {
            opacity: 0.5;
        }
        
        .features li.disabled i {
            color: var(--gray);
        }
        
        /* CARRELLO E CHECKOUT */
        .cart-modal {
            display: none;
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
            z-index: 2000;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
        }
        
        .cart-content {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 15px;
            width: 90%;
            max-width: 600px;
            max-height: 80vh;
            overflow-y: auto;
            padding: 30px;
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .close-cart {
            position: absolute;
            top: 15px;
            right: 20px;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            color: var(--gray);
        }
        
        .cart-items {
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        
        .cart-item {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 15px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
        }
        
        .cart-item-info h4 {
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        
        .cart-item-price {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--primary);
        }
        
        .cart-total {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 20px 0;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 2px solid #eee;
        }
        
        /* PROCESSO A STEP MIGLIORATO */
        .process-steps {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }
        
        .step {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 30px 25px;
            text-align: center;
            width: 220px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
            transition: transform 0.3s;
        }
        
        .step:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }
        
        .step-number {
            background: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 0 auto 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
        }
        
        .step h3 {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: var(--secondary);
        }
        
        /* FORM MIGLIORATO */
        .order-form-container {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        
        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }
        
        .form-group label {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--secondary);
        }
        
        .form-group input, .form-group select, .form-group textarea {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 14px 15px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            transition: border 0.3s;
        }
        
        .form-group input:focus, .form-group select:focus, .form-group textarea:focus {
            border-color: var(--primary);
            outline: none;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(67, 97, 238, 0.1);
        }
        
        .form-group textarea {
            min-height: 120px;
            resize: vertical;
        }
        
        .form-row {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 20px;
        }
        
        /* CUSTOMIZER MIGLIORATO */
        .customizer {
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
        
        .customizer-options {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }
        
        .option-card {
            background: var(--light);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 15px;
            text-align: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            border: 2px solid transparent;
        }
        
        .option-card.selected {
            border-color: var(--primary);
            background: rgba(67, 97, 238, 0.05);
        }
        
        .option-card h4 {
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            color: var(--secondary);
        }
        
        .option-card .price {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin: 10px 0;
            color: var(--primary);
        }
        
        /* PREVIEW DEL SITO */
        .site-preview {
            background: var(--light);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 25px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
        
        .preview-header {
            height: 20px;
            background: var(--primary);
            border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        
        .preview-nav {
            height: 40px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0 15px;
        }
        
        .preview-nav div {
            width: 30px;
            height: 5px;
            background: #eee;
            margin-right: 10px;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }
        
        .preview-hero {
            height: 150px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary));
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: white;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        
        .preview-content {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
            gap: 15px;
        }
        
        .preview-main {
            height: 200px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 5px;
            padding: 15px;
        }
        
        .preview-sidebar {
            height: 200px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 5px;
            padding: 15px;
        }
        
        /* FOOTER MIGLIORATO */
        footer {
            background: var(--dark);
            color: white;
            padding: 60px 0 20px;
            margin-top: 60px;
        }
        
        .footer-content {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        
        .footer-section h3 {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            color: var(--accent);
        }
        
        .footer-section ul {
            list-style: none;
        }
        
        .footer-section ul li {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        
        .footer-section a {
            color: #ddd;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: color 0.3s;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }
        
        .footer-section a i {
            margin-right: 8px;
            width: 20px;
        }
        
        .footer-section a:hover {
            color: white;
        }
        
        .social-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }
        
        .social-links a {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            border-radius: 50%;
            transition: background 0.3s;
        }
        
        .social-links a:hover {
            background: var(--primary);
        }
        
        .copyright {
            text-align: center;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #aaa;
        }
        
        /* RESPONSIVE */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .header-content {
                flex-direction: column;
                text-align: center;
            }
            
            nav ul {
                margin-top: 15px;
                justify-content: center;
            }
            
            nav ul li {
                margin: 0 10px;
            }
            
            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 2.2rem;
            }
            
            .packages {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            
            .package.popular::before {
                right: -25px;
                padding: 6px 25px;
                font-size: 0.7rem;
            }
            
            .process-steps {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: center;
            }
            
            .step {
                width: 100%;
                max-width: 300px;
            }
            
            .form-row {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            
            .preview-content {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }
        
        /* ANIMAZIONI */
        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
        
        .fade-in {
            animation: fadeIn 0.6s ease forwards;
        }
        
        /* UTILITY CLASSES */
        .text-center {
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .mt-20 {
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        
        .mb-20 {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        
        .hidden {
            display: none;
        }
        
        /* BADGE PER TEMPI DI CONSEGNA */
        .delivery-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: var(--success);
            color: white;
            padding: 5px 10px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-left: 10px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <div class="container">
            <div class="header-content">
                <div class="logo">
                    <i class="fas fa-bolt"></i>
                    Sito<span>Subito</span>
                </div>
                <nav>
                    <ul>
                        <li><a href="#home"><i class="fas fa-home"></i> Home</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#pacchetti"><i class="fas fa-box"></i> Pacchetti</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#funzionalita"><i class="fas fa-cogs"></i> Funzionalità</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#ordina"><i class="fas fa-shopping-cart"></i> Ordina</a></li>
                        <li class="cart-icon">
                            <a href="#" id="cart-toggle">
                                <i class="fas fa-shopping-cart"></i> Carrello
                                <span class="cart-count">0</span>
                            </a>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </nav>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Carrello Modal -->
    <div class="cart-modal" id="cart-modal">
        <div class="cart-content">
            <span class="close-cart" id="close-cart">&times;</span>
            <h2><i class="fas fa-shopping-cart"></i> Il Tuo Carrello</h2>
            <div class="cart-items" id="cart-items">
                <!-- Gli elementi del carrello verranno inseriti qui dinamicamente -->
            </div>
            <div class="cart-total">
                <span>Totale:</span>
                <span id="cart-total">€0</span>
            </div>
            <button class="btn btn-success btn-large" style="width: 100%;" id="checkout-btn">
                <i class="fas fa-credit-card"></i> Procedi al Checkout
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <section class="hero" id="home">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="hero-content">
                <h1>Il tuo sito web, pronto subito!</h1>
                <p>Con SitoSubito crei il sito dei tuoi sogni in pochi click. Professionale, veloce e su misura per te.</p>
                <a href="#pacchetti" class="btn btn-large"><i class="fas fa-rocket"></i> Vedi i Pacchetti</a>
                <p class="mt-20"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i> Soddisfatto o rimborsato entro 14 giorni</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="pacchetti">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title">Scegli il pacchetto perfetto</h2>
            
            <div class="packages">
                <div class="package fade-in">
                    <h3>Base <span class="delivery-badge">7 giorni</span></h3>
                    <p class="subtitle">Perfetto per piccoli business e professionisti</p>
                    <div class="price">€299<span>/una tantum</span></div>
                    <ul class="features">
                        <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Sito web responsive (5 pagine)</li>
                        <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Design moderno e pulito</li>
                        <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Form di contatto</li>
                        <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Ottimizzazione base SEO</li>
                        <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Hosting per 1 anno incluso</li>
                        <li class="disabled"><i class="fas fa-times"></i> E-commerce</li>
                        <li class="disabled"><i class="fas fa-times"></i> Blog integrato</li>
                    </ul>
                    <button class="btn add-to-cart" data-package="base" data-price="299">Aggiungi al Carrello</button>
                </div>
                
                <div class="package popular fade-in">
                    <h3>Business <span class="delivery-badge">10 giorni</span></h3>
                    <p class="subtitle">Ideale per aziende in crescita</p>
                    <div class="price">€599<span>/una tantum</span></div>
                    <ul class="features">
                        <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Tutto il pacchetto Base</li>
                        <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Fino a 15 pagine</li>
                        <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Design personalizzato</li>
                        <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Blog integrato</li>
                        <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Ottimizzazione SEO avanzata</li>
                        <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Hosting per 1 anno incluso</li>
                        <li class="disabled"><i class="fas fa-times"></i> E-commerce avanzato</li>
                    </ul>
                    <button class="btn add-to-cart" data-package="business" data-price="599">Aggiungi al Carrello</button>
                </div>
                
                <div class="package fade-in">
                    <h3>Premium <span class="delivery-badge">15 giorni</span></h3>
                    <p class="subtitle">La soluzione completa per il tuo business</p>
                    <div class="price">€999<span>/una tantum</span></div>
                    <ul class="features">
                        <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Tutto il pacchetto Business</li>
                        <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Pagine illimitate</li>
                        <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> E-commerce completo</li>
                        <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Design unico e su misura</li>
                        <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Integrazione pagamenti online</li>
                        <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Area riservata clienti</li>
                        <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Hosting per 1 anno incluso</li>
                    </ul>
                    <button class="btn add-to-cart" data-package="premium" data-price="999">Aggiungi al Carrello</button>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="text-center mt-20">
                <p>Hai bisogno di qualcosa di specifico? <a href="#ordina" style="color: var(--primary); font-weight: 600;">Contattaci per un preventivo personalizzato</a></p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="funzionalita" style="background: #f0f5ff;">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-title">Funzionalità Aggiuntive</h2>
            
            <div class="customizer">
                <div class="customizer-options">
                    <div class="option-card" data-feature="seo" data-price="120">
                        <i class="fas fa-search fa-2x"></i>
                        <h4>SEO Avanzata</h4>
                        <p>Migliora il posizionamento sui motori di ricerca</p>
                        <div class="price">+ €120</div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="option-card" data-feature="blog" data-price="100">
                        <i class="fas fa-blog fa-2x"></i>
                        <h4>Blog Integrato</h4>
                        <p>Gestione contenuti e articoli</p>
                        <div class="price">+ €100</div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="option-card" data-feature="multilingua" data-price="150">
